<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'PathHub - ファイルパス共有を、もっとスマートに。' }) %>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800">

    <div class="container mx-auto p-4 md:p-8 max-w-4xl">

        <header class="text-center mb-10">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-800">PathHub</h1>
            <p class="text-gray-500 mt-2 text-lg">ファイルパス共有を、もっとスマートに。</p>
        </header>

        <main class="bg-white p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-gray-200">
            <div class="text-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-12 w-12 mx-auto text-blue-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 105.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 005.656 0l4-4a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-1.1 1.1" />
                </svg>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-4">共有リンクを生成</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-500 mt-1">パスは1行に1つ。複数行入力で一括共有できます。</p>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
                        <label for="pathInput" class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700">ファイルパス <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                        <button id="pasteButton" type="button" class="text-xs bg-gray-200 text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-300 font-semibold py-1 px-3 rounded-md transition-colors">クリップボードから貼り付け</button>
                    </div>
                    <textarea id="pathInput" rows="3" class="w-full p-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-blue-500 transition-shadow font-mono text-sm" placeholder="例: C:\Users\hiro\Documents&#10;\\server01\share\プロジェクト資料"></textarea>
                    <p id="pathCount" class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">0 件</p>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                    <div>
                        <label for="tagsInput" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">タグ <span class="text-gray-400 text-xs font-normal">(任意・最大5個・カンマ区切り)</span></label>
                        <input id="tagsInput" type="text" maxlength="200" class="w-full p-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-blue-500" placeholder="例: 設計資料, prj-x">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label for="expiresInput" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">有効期限</label>
                        <select id="expiresInput" class="w-full p-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-blue-500">
                            <option value="7">7 日</option>
                            <option value="30">30 日</option>
                            <option value="90" selected>90 日</option>
                            <option value="365">1 年</option>
                            <option value="0">無期限</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="noteInput" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">メモ <span class="text-gray-400 text-xs font-normal">(任意・200文字まで)</span></label>
                    <textarea id="noteInput" rows="2" maxlength="200" class="w-full p-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-blue-500" placeholder="このリンクの目的や注意点を相手に伝えるメモ"></textarea>
                </div>

                <button id="generateButton" class="w-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 focus:ring-blue-300 transition-all disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed">
                    <span id="buttonText">共有リンクを生成する</span>
                    <div id="buttonLoader" class="loading hidden"></div>
                </button>
            </div>

            <div id="errorArea" class="mt-4 hidden">
                <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-4">
                    <div class="flex">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM8.707 7.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414L8.586 10l-1.293 1.293a1 1 0 101.414 1.414L10 11.414l1.293 1.293a1 1 0 001.414-1.414L11.414 10l1.293-1.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L10 8.586 8.707 7.293z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                        </svg>
                        <div class="ml-3">
                            <h3 class="text-sm font-medium text-red-800">エラーが発生しました</h3>
                            <p id="errorMessage" class="mt-1 text-sm text-red-700"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="resultArea" class="mt-8 hidden fade-in">
                <div class="bg-gray-100 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-200">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">共有リンクが生成されました！</h3>

                    <div class="space-y-3">
                        <div>
                            <label class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wide">通常の共有リンク</label>
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 bg-white p-3 rounded-md border">
                                <input type="text" id="sharedLink" class="flex-grow bg-transparent border-none focus:ring-0" readonly>
                                <button id="copyLinkButton" type="button" class="bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 hover:bg-blue-200 font-semibold py-1 px-3 rounded-md text-sm transition-colors">コピー</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wide">自動実行リンク（推奨）</label>
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 bg-green-50 p-3 rounded-md border border-green-200">
                                <input type="text" id="autoSharedLink" class="flex-grow bg-transparent border-none focus:ring-0" readonly>
                                <button id="copyAutoLinkButton" type="button" class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 hover:bg-green-200 font-semibold py-1 px-3 rounded-md text-sm transition-colors">コピー</button>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-xs text-green-600 mt-1">単一パスの共有時のみ自動実行に対応しています。</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <p id="copyStatus" class="text-green-600 text-sm mt-1 h-4"></p>

                    <div id="previewArea" class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t">
                        <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-500 text-sm mb-2">相手にはこのように表示されます:</h4>
                        <div class="border rounded-lg p-4 bg-white shadow-sm space-y-3">
                            <div id="previewNote" class="hidden bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded-md p-3 text-sm text-yellow-900 whitespace-pre-wrap"></div>
                            <div id="previewTags" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"></div>
                            <ul id="previewList" class="divide-y divide-gray-100"></ul>
                            <p id="previewExpiry" class="text-xs text-gray-400 text-right"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>

        <footer class="text-center mt-10 text-gray-400 text-sm">
            <p>&copy; 2025 PathHub. All Rights Reserved.</p>
        </footer>
    </div>

    <script defer src="/js/index-page.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
